    input:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #fdba74; outline-offset: 1px; }
    .row { display: flex; gap: .5rem; align-items: flex-end; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .row > div { flex: 1 1 120px; min-width: 0; }
    .btn { border: 0; border-radius: 8px; padding: .6rem 1rem; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
    .btn:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }
    .btn.ghost { background: #f5f5f4; color: var(--text); }
    .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .4rem; margin: .75rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .3rem; background: #ffedd5; border-radius: 999px; padding: .2rem .35rem .2rem .75rem; font-size: .9rem; }
    .chip button { border: 0; background: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1; padding: .2rem .4rem; border-radius: 999px; }
    .toggle { border: 1px solid #d6d3d1; background: #fff; border-radius: 999px; padding: .25rem .7rem; font: inherit; font-size: .85rem; cursor: pointer; }
    .toggle[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
    fieldset { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: .75rem 0; }
    legend { font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
    .error { color: #b91c1c; font-size: .85rem; min-height: 1.2em; margin: .3rem 0 0; }
    .items { list-style: none; margin: .75rem 0 0; padding: 0; }
    .item { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: .6rem 0; }
    .item-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: .5rem; }
    .item-name { font-weight: 600; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .item .chips { margin-top: .35rem; }
    .del { border: 0; background: none; color: #b91c1c; cursor: pointer; font: inherit; font-size: .85rem; }
    .check { display: flex; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; font-weight: 400; margin-top: .6rem; }
    .hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; margin: .4rem 0 0; }
    .result { position: sticky; top: 1rem; }
    .person { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: .6rem .75rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
    .person-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-weight: 700; gap: .5rem; }
    .person-top span:last-child { color: var(--accent-dark); white-space: nowrap; }
    .person small { color: var(--muted); display: block; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .grand { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; border-top: 2px dashed var(--border); padding-top: .6rem; margin-top: .6rem; }
    .warning { background: #fef3c7; color: var(--warn); border-radius: 8px; padding: .5rem .7rem; font-size: .85rem; }
    textarea { width: 100%; min-height: 150px; font: .85rem ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; border: 1px solid #d6d3d1; border-radius: 8px; padding: .5rem; margin-top: .75rem; resize: vertical; }
    .actions { display: flex; gap: .5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: .5rem; }
    #copy-status { color: var(--ok); font-size: .85rem; margin: .3rem 0 0; min-height: 1.2em; }
    .empty { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
    @media (max-width: 800px) { main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .result { position: static; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Kalkulator Patungan</h1>
    <p>Bagi tagihan makan bareng secara adil, termasuk menu yang dimakan bersama.</p>
  </header>
  <main>
    <div>
      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="people-title">
        <h2 id="people-title">1. Siapa saja yang ikut?</h2>
        <form id="person-form" class="row" novalidate>
          <div><label for="person-name">Nama</label><input type="text" id="person-name" maxlength="30" placeholder="mis. Andi"></div>
          <button class="btn" type="submit">Tambah</button>
        </form>
        <p class="error" id="person-error" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <ul class="chips" id="people"></ul>
      </section>

      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="items-title">
        <h2 id="items-title">2. Pesanan</h2>
        <form id="item-form" novalidate>
          <div class="row">
            <div><label for="item-name">Menu</label><input type="text" id="item-name" maxlength="40" placeholder="mis. Nasi goreng"></div>
            <div><label for="item-price">Harga satuan (Rp)</label><input type="text" id="item-price" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="25.000"></div>
            <div style="flex-basis:70px"><label for="item-qty">Jumlah</label><input type="number" id="item-qty" min="1" value="1"></div>
          </div>
          <fieldset>
            <legend>Dimakan oleh (pilih lebih dari satu untuk dibagi rata)</legend>
            <div class="chips" id="item-shares"></div>
          </fieldset>
          <button class="btn" type="submit">Tambah menu</button>
          <p class="error" id="item-error" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
        <ul class="items" id="items"></ul>
      </section>

      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="fees-title">
        <h2 id="fees-title">3. Diskon, service, dan pajak</h2>
        <div class="row">
          <div><label for="discount">Diskon/promo (Rp)</label><input type="text" id="discount" inputmode="numeric" value="0"></div>
          <div><label for="service">Service charge (%)</label><input type="number" id="service" min="0" max="100" step="0.5" value="5"></div>
          <div><label for="tax">Pajak restoran (%)</label><input type="number" id="tax" min="0" max="100" step="0.5" value="10"></div>
        </div>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="tax-after-service" checked> Pajak dihitung dari subtotal + service</label>
        <p class="hint">Samakan dengan struk. Diskon dibagi sebanding dengan pesanan tiap orang, lalu service dan pajak dihitung setelah diskon.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <aside class="card result" aria-labelledby="result-title">
      <h2 id="result-title">Yang harus dibayar</h2>
      <div id="warning" class="warning" hidden></div>
      <div id="result" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div class="grand"><span>Total tagihan</span><span id="grand-total">Rp 0</span></div>
      <label for="summary" style="margin-top:.75rem">Teks untuk grup WA</label>
      <textarea id="summary" readonly></textarea>
      <div class="actions">
        <button class="btn" type="button" id="copy">Salin ringkasan</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" type="button" id="example">Isi contoh</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" type="button" id="reset">Mulai baru</button>
      </div>
      <p id="copy-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <script>
    const STORAGE_KEY = 'patungan-v1';
    const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
    const rp = (n) => 'Rp ' + Math.round(n).toLocaleString('id-ID');
    const parseRp = (s) => parseInt(String(s).replace(/\D/g, ''), 10) || 0;
    const clampPct = (v) => Math.min(100, Math.max(0, parseFloat(v) || 0));
    // Nama orang dan menu adalah input pengguna, jadi di-escape sebelum masuk ke innerHTML.
    const esc = (s) => String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g, (c) => `&#${c.charCodeAt(0)};`);

    const EMPTY = { people: [], items: [], nextId: 1, discount: 0, service: 5, tax: 10, taxAfterService: true };
    let state = { ...EMPTY };
    const selectedForNew = new Set();

    const save = () => { try { localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(state)); } catch (e) { /* mode privat */ } };
    try {
      const s = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY));
      if (s && Array.isArray(s.people) && Array.isArray(s.items)) state = { ...state, ...s };
    } catch (e) { /* data rusak, mulai kosong */ }

    // ---------- Perhitungan ----------
    function compute() {
      const per = new Map(state.people.map((p) => [p.id, { sub: 0, menus: [] }]));
      const unassigned = [];
      let itemsTotal = 0;
      for (const it of state.items) {
        const sharers = it.shares.filter((id) => per.has(id));
        if (!sharers.length) { unassigned.push(it.name); continue; }
        itemsTotal += it.price * it.qty;
        for (const id of sharers) {
          per.get(id).sub += it.price * it.qty / sharers.length;
          per.get(id).menus.push(sharers.length > 1 ? `${it.name} (1/${sharers.length})` : it.name);
        }
      }
      const discount = Math.min(state.discount, itemsTotal);
      const rows = state.people.map((p) => {
        const { sub, menus } = per.get(p.id);
        const disc = itemsTotal ? discount * sub / itemsTotal : 0; // diskon dibagi sebanding pesanan
        const service = (sub - disc) * state.service / 100;
        const tax = (state.taxAfterService ? sub - disc + service : sub - disc) * state.tax / 100;
        return { name: p.name, sub, disc, service, tax, exact: sub - disc + service + tax, menus };
      });
      // Bulatkan ke rupiah penuh tanpa selisih: sisa pembulatan diberikan ke pecahan terbesar.
      const grand = Math.round(rows.reduce((a, r) => a + r.exact, 0));
      rows.forEach((r) => { r.pay = Math.floor(r.exact); });
      let rest = grand - rows.reduce((a, r) => a + r.pay, 0);
      [...rows].sort((a, b) => (b.exact - b.pay) - (a.exact - a.pay)).forEach((r) => { if (rest-- > 0) r.pay++; });
      return { rows, grand, unassigned, discount };
    }

    // ---------- Tampilan ----------
    const toggles = (isOn, attrs) => state.people.map((p) =>
      `<button type="button" class="toggle" ${attrs} data-person="${p.id}" aria-pressed="${isOn(p.id)}">${esc(p.name)}</button>`).join('');

    function render() {
      $('people').innerHTML = state.people.map((p) =>
        `<li class="chip">${esc(p.name)}<button type="button" data-remove-person="${p.id}" aria-label="Hapus ${esc(p.name)}">×</button></li>`).join('');
      $('item-shares').innerHTML = toggles((id) => selectedForNew.has(id), '')
        || '<span class="empty">Tambahkan orang dulu di langkah 1.</span>';
      $('items').innerHTML = state.items.map((it, i) => `<li class="item">
        <div class="item-head"><span class="item-name">${it.qty}× ${esc(it.name)} — ${rp(it.price * it.qty)}</span>
        <button type="button" class="del" data-remove-item="${i}" aria-label="Hapus ${esc(it.name)}">Hapus</button></div>
        <div class="chips" aria-label="Yang makan ${esc(it.name)}">${toggles((id) => it.shares.includes(id), `data-item="${i}"`)}</div></li>`).join('');

      const { rows, grand, unassigned, discount } = compute();
      $('result').innerHTML = rows.map((r) => `<div class="person">
        <div class="person-top"><span>${esc(r.name)}</span><span>${rp(r.pay)}</span></div>
        <small>${esc(r.menus.join(', ') || 'Belum ada menu')}</small>
        <small>Pesanan ${rp(r.sub)} − diskon ${rp(r.disc)} + service ${rp(r.service)} + pajak ${rp(r.tax)}</small></div>`).join('')
        || '<p class="empty">Belum ada data. Tambahkan orang dan pesanan, atau klik "Isi contoh".</p>';
      $('grand-total').textContent = rp(grand);
      $('warning').hidden = !unassigned.length;
      $('warning').textContent = `Belum dipilih siapa yang makan: ${unassigned.join(', ')}. Menu ini belum dihitung.`;

      const date = new Date().toLocaleDateString('id-ID', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' });
      $('summary').value = rows.length ? [`Patungan ${date}`, '',
        ...rows.map((r) => `${r.name}: ${rp(r.pay)} (${r.menus.join(', ') || '-'})`), '', `Total: ${rp(grand)}`,
        `Service ${state.service}%, pajak ${state.tax}%${discount ? `, diskon ${rp(discount)}` : ''}`].join('\n') : '';
    }

    function syncFeeInputs() {
      $('discount').value = state.discount.toLocaleString('id-ID');
      $('service').value = state.service;
      $('tax').value = state.tax;
      $('tax-after-service').checked = state.taxAfterService;
    }

    const update = () => { save(); render(); };

    // ---------- Event ----------
    $('person-form').addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = $('person-name').value.trim();
      const dup = state.people.some((p) => p.name.toLowerCase() === name.toLowerCase());
      $('person-error').textContent = !name ? 'Nama wajib diisi.' : dup ? `${name} sudah ada.` : '';
      if (!name || dup) return;
      state.people.push({ id: state.nextId++, name });
      $('person-name').value = '';
      update();
    });

    $('item-form').addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = $('item-name').value.trim();
      const price = parseRp($('item-price').value);
      const err = !name ? 'Nama menu wajib diisi.' : !price ? 'Harga harus lebih dari 0.'
        : !selectedForNew.size ? 'Pilih minimal satu orang yang makan menu ini.' : '';
      $('item-error').textContent = err;
      if (err) return;
      state.items.push({ name, price, qty: Math.max(1, parseInt($('item-qty').value, 10) || 1), shares: [...selectedForNew] });
      $('item-form').reset();
      selectedForNew.clear();
      $('item-name').focus();
      update();
    });

    document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      const b = e.target.closest('button');
      if (!b) return;
      const d = b.dataset;
      if (d.removePerson) {
        const id = Number(d.removePerson);
        state.people = state.people.filter((p) => p.id !== id);
        selectedForNew.delete(id);
        update();
      } else if (d.removeItem) {
        state.items.splice(Number(d.removeItem), 1);
        update();
      } else if (d.person) {
        const id = Number(d.person);
        const set = d.item ? new Set(state.items[d.item].shares) : selectedForNew;
        set.has(id) ? set.delete(id) : set.add(id);
        if (d.item) state.items[d.item].shares = [...set];
        update();
      }
    });

    const money = (input, onChange) => input.addEventListener('input', () => {
      const n = parseRp(input.value);
      input.value = n ? n.toLocaleString('id-ID') : '';
      if (onChange) onChange(n);
    });
    money($('item-price'));
    money($('discount'), (n) => { state.discount = n; update(); });
    $('service').addEventListener('input', (e) => { state.service = clampPct(e.target.value); update(); });
    $('tax').addEventListener('input', (e) => { state.tax = clampPct(e.target.value); update(); });
    $('tax-after-service').addEventListener('change', (e) => { state.taxAfterService = e.target.checked; update(); });

    $('copy').addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const text = $('summary').value;
      if (!text) { $('copy-status').textContent = 'Belum ada yang bisa disalin.'; return; }
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
        $('copy-status').textContent = 'Ringkasan disalin. Tinggal tempel di grup.';
      } catch (e) {
        $('summary').select(); // clipboard diblokir (mis. dibuka dari file://): pilih teks agar bisa disalin manual
        $('copy-status').textContent = 'Tidak bisa menyalin otomatis. Teks sudah dipilih, tekan Ctrl+C.';
      }
    });

    $('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (!confirm('Hapus semua orang dan pesanan?')) return;
      state = { ...EMPTY, people: [], items: [], service: state.service, tax: state.tax, taxAfterService: state.taxAfterService };
      selectedForNew.clear();
      syncFeeInputs();
      update();
    });

    $('example').addEventListener('click', () => {
      const item = (name, price, qty, shares) => ({ name, price, qty, shares });
      state = {
        ...EMPTY, nextId: 4, discount: 10000,
        people: [{ id: 1, name: 'Andi' }, { id: 2, name: 'Budi' }, { id: 3, name: 'Citra' }],
        items: [item('Nasi goreng', 25000, 1, [1]), item('Mie ayam', 20000, 1, [2]), item('Es teh', 5000, 3, [1, 2, 3]),
          item('Pisang goreng', 18000, 1, [1, 3]), item('Ayam bakar', 30000, 1, [3])],
      };
      selectedForNew.clear();
      syncFeeInputs();
      update();
    });

    syncFeeInputs();
    render();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
```

**Cek kebutuhan**
- **Nama orang** → form langkah 1. Nama yang sama tidak bisa dimasukkan dua kali, dan setiap orang bisa dihapus.
- **Pesanan masing-masing** → form langkah 2 berisi menu, harga satuan, jumlah, dan siapa yang makan. Pilihan orang bisa diubah lagi lewat tombol nama di bawah setiap menu.
- **Menu yang dimakan bareng dibagi rata** → `compute()` membagi harga menu dengan jumlah orang yang dipilih, misalnya 3 es teh untuk 3 orang.
- **Pajak restoran dan service charge (%)** → dihitung setelah diskon. Opsi "pajak dihitung dari subtotal + service" bisa dimatikan supaya hasilnya sama dengan struk.
- **Diskon/promo** → dibagi sebanding dengan nilai pesanan tiap orang. Yang pesannya lebih banyak mendapat potongan lebih besar.
- **Berapa yang harus dibayar tiap orang** → satu kartu per orang, lengkap dengan rinciannya. Pembulatan ke rupiah memakai metode sisa terbesar, jadi jumlah bayaran semua orang selalu sama persis dengan total tagihan.
- **Salin ringkasan ke grup WA** → teks di `#summary` disalin dengan `navigator.clipboard`. Jika browser memblokirnya, misalnya karena file dibuka langsung dari komputer, teksnya dipilih otomatis supaya bisa disalin manual.
- **Aman dari input aneh** → nama orang dan menu di-escape dengan `esc()` sebelum ditampilkan.

Klik **Isi contoh** untuk melihat simulasinya: tiga orang, lima menu, diskon Rp10.000, service 5%, pajak 10%, dengan total Rp113.190.

**Catatan soal pajak restoran**
- Makanan dan minuman yang disajikan restoran tidak dikenai PPN. Yang berlaku adalah pajak daerah, yaitu Pajak Barang dan Jasa Tertentu (PBJT) atas makanan dan minuman, menurut UU No. 1 Tahun 2022 tentang Hubungan Keuangan antara Pemerintah Pusat dan Pemerintahan Daerah. Tarifnya paling tinggi 10% dan ditetapkan Perda masing-masing daerah, jadi angkanya bisa berbeda antardaerah.
- Service charge bukan pajak, melainkan kebijakan restoran. Karena itu kalkulator ini memisahkan keduanya, dan persentasenya bisa diatur sendiri.

Berikut simulasi kasir toko kelontong dalam satu file HTML, tanpa server. Semua data disimpan di `localStorage` browser.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
